// Every piece of on-screen text, one line per string: S(id, English, Spanish).
// Included by i18n.h (ids) and i18n.cpp (tables). To add a language, add a
// column here and to i18n::Lang. Text is UTF-8; characters outside ASCII need
// a glyph in kGlyphs (render.cpp). Screen is 200 px wide: 33 chars at size 1,
// 16 at size 2.

// Main menu (label under the selected icon)
S(MenuFeed, "Feed", "Comer")
S(MenuPlay, "Play", "Jugar")
S(MenuLight, "Light", "Luz")
S(MenuClean, "Clean", "Lavar")
S(MenuCure, "Cure", "Cura")
